WEBVTT

00:00:41.583 --> 00:00:43.333
Ah! Sis!

00:00:43.333 --> 00:00:45.375
Help! Sis!

00:00:49.958 --> 00:00:51.208
Sis!

00:01:18.375 --> 00:01:20.833
Why am I having that dream now?

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:22.917
Wait for me!

00:01:22.917 --> 00:01:25.167
Hurry up, or we'll leave without you!

00:01:25.167 --> 00:01:26.333
Ahh...

00:01:27.417 --> 00:01:31.208
I feel dizzy again.
I wonder if I'm a bit anemic...

00:01:38.542 --> 00:01:39.417
"Chick" "Oranges"

00:01:41.167 --> 00:01:42.833
"Oranges" "Oranges"

00:01:43.083 --> 00:01:45.708
What're you doing so early in the morning, Sis?

00:01:45.708 --> 00:01:47.208
Spring-cleaning!

00:01:47.208 --> 00:01:51.458
I have to tidy up thoroughly,
since Aria's coming to visit!

00:01:51.458 --> 00:01:54.750
Ahhh...! It's getting messier
and messier instead!

00:01:58.958 --> 00:02:02.792
That's right. It happened
a long, long time ago.

00:02:02.792 --> 00:02:06.125
I live a normal life with Sis now.

00:02:06.125 --> 00:02:08.208
Nonoka! Could you work on the kitchen?!

00:02:08.208 --> 00:02:11.458
I haven't put away the
dishes from last night yet!

00:02:11.458 --> 00:02:12.875
Okay!

00:02:12.875 --> 00:02:14.958
Ah! She's here!

00:02:14.958 --> 00:02:16.958
Coming! Coming! Coming!

00:02:17.750 --> 00:02:22.042
Good morning. I'll stay at your
place for a while starting today.

00:02:22.042 --> 00:02:24.417
Huh? For a while?

00:03:57.167 --> 00:03:59.333
Evacuation?

00:03:59.333 --> 00:04:00.333
That's right.

00:04:00.333 --> 00:04:04.292
There's been a series of
attacks targeting <i>butei</i>, right?

00:04:04.292 --> 00:04:08.750
Ms. Takamagahara suggested
that I relocate for a while

00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:12.792
just in case anyone out there holds
a personal vendetta against me,

00:04:12.792 --> 00:04:16.667
considering how many
criminals I've caught in Japan.

00:04:16.667 --> 00:04:20.500
But it's proof that you're
an excellent <i>butei</i>, right?

00:04:20.500 --> 00:04:23.667
It means that you solved many crimes!

00:04:23.667 --> 00:04:25.792
You're so simple-minded!

00:04:25.792 --> 00:04:28.958
At any rate, that's why I want you
to let me stay with you for a while.

00:04:28.958 --> 00:04:32.583
It's a good opportunity
to see how you live, too.

00:04:32.583 --> 00:04:36.542
Y-Yes, ma'am! I'll tend to you as best I can!

00:04:36.542 --> 00:04:39.583
This is a small place, but please let us
know if we can do anything for you!

00:04:39.583 --> 00:04:43.625
Hey, hey, it's me that's asking a favor of you.

00:04:50.125 --> 00:04:53.208
As I suspected, their parents
don't seem to be living with them.

00:04:53.208 --> 00:04:53.583
"Strawberry au lait"

00:04:53.583 --> 00:04:55.792
Cohabitating with Aria?!

00:04:56.958 --> 00:04:59.000
We're just living together.

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:01.917
Since there might be
bad guys out there after Aria,

00:05:01.917 --> 00:05:04.125
she's just evacuating to my place for a while.

00:05:06.125 --> 00:05:08.500
Then you'll be with her all
the time except during school?

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:10.125
Is there even room for her to sleep?

00:05:10.125 --> 00:05:14.375
It'll be fine. I'll have her sleep in my bed.

00:05:14.375 --> 00:05:15.167
Wha...?!

00:05:15.167 --> 00:05:18.583
I'm nervous, but more than that,
I'm so looking forward to it!

00:05:18.583 --> 00:05:20.958
We'll be doing things together,
like shopping and cooking.

00:05:20.958 --> 00:05:23.500
I'll ask her to tell me
all sorts of stories, too!

00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:26.750
There are so many things
I want to do with her!

00:05:28.458 --> 00:05:30.208
Sounds like you're a newlywed couple.

00:05:30.208 --> 00:05:34.250
--Oh, that sounds silly.
--Cohabitating... Being with her all the time... Akari's bed...

00:05:34.250 --> 00:05:35.583
--Hm? Hey, Shino, what's wrong?
--Shopping and cooking together...!

00:05:35.583 --> 00:05:36.958
--Hm? Hey, Shino, what's wrong?
--Cooking... A newlywed couple...

00:05:36.958 --> 00:05:39.125
Shino?

00:05:39.125 --> 00:05:39.875
Did you hear that?

00:05:39.875 --> 00:05:40.792
Yes, I did.

00:05:40.792 --> 00:05:43.333
Aria Kanzaki and Akari Mamiya are...

00:05:43.333 --> 00:05:45.000
...cohabitating!

00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:47.667
We have to report this to Miss Urara!

00:05:47.667 --> 00:05:49.167
"Sale! Get Double Smiley Stamps!"

00:05:49.167 --> 00:05:50.667
"Sale"

00:06:00.833 --> 00:06:02.333
"Traffic Safety"
"Neighborhood Bulletin Board "

00:06:07.583 --> 00:06:09.292
Hello, Miss!

00:06:09.292 --> 00:06:13.042
Oh, Akari! We've got good yellowtail today!

00:06:13.042 --> 00:06:15.125
Whoa! Sounds delicious!

00:06:15.125 --> 00:06:19.208
You're a good customer,
so I'll give you a discount!

00:06:19.208 --> 00:06:21.708
Really?! Thank you!

00:06:22.500 --> 00:06:24.917
"Japanese-style Confectionery"
Oh, hi, Akari!

00:06:24.917 --> 00:06:26.708
Hello!

00:06:26.708 --> 00:06:29.417
You went shopping?
Looks like you got a lot.

00:06:29.417 --> 00:06:32.292
Yes. I got some free gifts, too, so...

00:06:32.292 --> 00:06:34.167
Oh, yeah! Here, I'll give you this.

00:06:34.167 --> 00:06:36.792
Wow...! Thank you!

00:06:36.792 --> 00:06:37.875
Bye-bye!

00:06:37.875 --> 00:06:40.083
See ya, Akari!

00:06:48.375 --> 00:06:52.500
I was surprised that you knew so many people.

00:06:54.083 --> 00:06:56.542
I had quite a bit of fun, too,

00:06:56.542 --> 00:07:00.167
since I rarely go shopping
in that kind of place.

00:07:00.167 --> 00:07:05.250
Where do you usually go shopping
for things like clothes and food?

00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:09.083
Hmm... My clothes are mostly custom-made.

00:07:09.083 --> 00:07:11.333
As for food, I usually
eat out or use delivery services.

00:07:11.333 --> 00:07:12.333
Whoa...

00:07:12.333 --> 00:07:16.458
Your lifestyle really is different from ours.

00:07:16.458 --> 00:07:17.833
Aria?

00:07:19.792 --> 00:07:22.583
Ahhh!

00:07:22.583 --> 00:07:24.833
Don't worry. They were just blank shots.

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:28.375
Takachiho? Sasaki?

00:07:28.375 --> 00:07:31.792
Hm? What? You came to say hi?

00:07:31.792 --> 00:07:34.042
Y-Yes, sort of...

00:07:34.042 --> 00:07:36.375
Something like that.

00:07:38.667 --> 00:07:41.542
Your presence is too strong.

00:07:41.542 --> 00:07:44.458
And you should work more on your tailing skills.

00:07:45.958 --> 00:07:48.792
Hello, everyone!

00:07:48.792 --> 00:07:51.875
So how's it going?

00:07:51.875 --> 00:07:54.625
Whoa... We have many visitors today.

00:07:54.625 --> 00:07:55.958
This is good timing!

00:07:55.958 --> 00:07:58.750
We've got lots of food,
so let's all cook together!

00:07:58.750 --> 00:08:01.458
Ah, but we don't have enough aprons.

00:08:01.458 --> 00:08:04.167
Leave it to me.

00:08:04.167 --> 00:08:06.708
Yuyu! Yaya! Here's your order!

00:08:13.167 --> 00:08:17.208
"Ya" "Yu"

00:08:30.083 --> 00:08:32.333
Splash, splash, splash...

00:08:32.333 --> 00:08:36.208
Raika, let's get close.

00:08:36.208 --> 00:08:38.083
"Coffee Milk" "Strawberry Milk" "Milk"

00:08:39.917 --> 00:08:42.333
Ahem!

00:08:42.333 --> 00:08:43.542
Ah!

00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:46.125
Hey!

00:08:49.208 --> 00:08:51.292
Raika...

00:09:01.250 --> 00:09:03.542
Aria...

00:09:13.583 --> 00:09:15.917
You were up?!

00:09:15.917 --> 00:09:20.375
<i>Butei </i>should always be on guard.

00:09:20.375 --> 00:09:22.042
Write this down, too.

00:09:22.042 --> 00:09:23.583
Aww...

00:09:33.625 --> 00:09:39.583
Aria, do you start your training
this early in the morning every day?

00:09:39.583 --> 00:09:44.000
Not every day, but whenever I can, I try to.

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:47.083
How far are we running?

00:09:47.083 --> 00:09:51.083
I'll stop around 10 km today... since you
look like you're having a tough time.

00:09:51.083 --> 00:09:52.417
10 km?!

00:10:06.458 --> 00:10:09.083
Okay, we're here! Good job.

00:10:13.792 --> 00:10:18.083
This is it for me! My heart is pounding!

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:23.000
Now, look over there.

00:10:23.000 --> 00:10:24.292
Hm?

00:10:25.625 --> 00:10:29.500
Ah... Wow...!

00:10:29.750 --> 00:10:34.250
Not bad, right? I wanted
to show you this scenery.

00:10:34.250 --> 00:10:35.625
Ah...

00:10:35.625 --> 00:10:37.958
Now, let's get going.

00:10:37.958 --> 00:10:40.333
When we get home,
we'll do push-ups and sit-ups.

00:10:40.333 --> 00:10:42.083
Aww...

00:10:47.292 --> 00:10:49.208
I can't do it anymore.

00:10:49.208 --> 00:10:51.500
Welcome back. You must be exhausted.

00:10:51.500 --> 00:10:52.958
Where's everyone else?

00:10:52.958 --> 00:10:54.708
They're still sleeping.

00:10:54.708 --> 00:10:56.708
Are you okay, Sis?

00:10:56.708 --> 00:10:58.375
Hey! What's wrong?

00:11:00.042 --> 00:11:04.583
Well... I just felt dizzy.
Seems like I'm not completely awake yet.

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:12.000
Seriously, Aria is super incredible.

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:16.917
I wonder if I can really
become like her someday...

00:11:16.917 --> 00:11:20.167
She saw the morning glow
reflecting on the ocean with Akari...

00:11:20.167 --> 00:11:22.458
Unforgivable... Unforgivable...

00:11:22.458 --> 00:11:26.208
Oh, cheer up. First, you need
to become her official Amica.

00:11:26.208 --> 00:11:27.750
You start from there, right?

00:11:27.750 --> 00:11:29.417
Yeah...

00:11:29.417 --> 00:11:32.333
And then, you'll get her
to accept you as her partner.

00:11:32.333 --> 00:11:36.750
You'll investigate crimes together
in operations with cool names.

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:39.375
You'll move forward step by step like that.

00:11:41.750 --> 00:11:42.833
Yep!

00:11:42.833 --> 00:11:45.125
You're right! I'll do my best!

00:11:45.417 --> 00:11:46.125
"Pedestrians and Bicycles"

00:11:46.125 --> 00:11:48.375
How to be more like me?

00:11:48.375 --> 00:11:50.458
Yes. Even if I become your Amica,

00:11:50.458 --> 00:11:55.083
carry the same kind of gun as you,
and work hard, a lot harder than you,

00:11:55.083 --> 00:11:59.542
I feel that all those things
still wouldn't be enough, so...

00:11:59.542 --> 00:12:02.167
You wanna become like me that badly?

00:12:02.167 --> 00:12:03.625
Yes, I do!

00:12:03.625 --> 00:12:05.000
Why?

00:12:05.000 --> 00:12:06.958
"Why"?

00:12:06.958 --> 00:12:11.708
I admire you so much.
You're perfect as a <i>butei</i>.

00:12:11.708 --> 00:12:15.583
But there are other S-ranked <i>butei</i>, too.

00:12:15.583 --> 00:12:17.042
Why me?

00:12:17.042 --> 00:12:18.583
Ah, that's...

00:12:19.833 --> 00:12:23.042
...because you never violate the <i>Butei </i>Law!

00:12:23.042 --> 00:12:24.125
What?

00:12:24.125 --> 00:12:29.250
You always obey the <i>Butei </i>Law
and never fatally wound criminals!

00:12:29.250 --> 00:12:31.750
So...

00:12:31.750 --> 00:12:33.583
Sorry, hold on a sec.

00:12:36.125 --> 00:12:38.375
What's the matter?

00:12:38.375 --> 00:12:42.250
I'm thirsty. Could you go get
something to drink from that store?

00:12:42.250 --> 00:12:45.292
We'll talk after that.

00:12:45.292 --> 00:12:48.083
Okay. Is black tea okay?

00:12:48.083 --> 00:12:50.958
I'll leave it up to you.
I'll give you the money later.

00:12:50.958 --> 00:12:52.250
Okay!

00:12:52.250 --> 00:12:53.625
Oh, wait!

00:12:53.625 --> 00:12:55.833
Yes?

00:12:55.833 --> 00:12:57.917
I'd like to have some peach buns, too.

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:00.708
Okay!

00:13:13.625 --> 00:13:15.167
She took off! Go after her!

00:13:17.875 --> 00:13:18.792
That's...

00:13:18.792 --> 00:13:21.083
I'll follow them. You go let Akari know.

00:13:21.083 --> 00:13:22.167
Got it.

00:13:23.417 --> 00:13:24.667
Akari!

00:13:25.208 --> 00:13:27.333
Shino! What're you doing here?

00:13:27.333 --> 00:13:29.458
It's an emergency! Aria is...

00:13:44.958 --> 00:13:49.167
Yuyu! Yaya! Go to the location
I'm about to give you,

00:13:49.167 --> 00:13:51.500
and follow a white van moving recklessly!

00:13:51.500 --> 00:13:52.833
The license plate number is...

00:13:52.833 --> 00:13:54.833
I got a text from Takachiho.

00:13:54.833 --> 00:13:58.667
Looks like Aria is headed towards the
redevelopment zone on the bayside.

00:13:58.667 --> 00:14:01.042
A white car? What kind?

00:14:01.042 --> 00:14:02.667
How many people were in the car?

00:14:02.667 --> 00:14:04.458
We couldn't tell.

00:14:04.458 --> 00:14:08.000
But it was definitely following Aria.

00:14:08.000 --> 00:14:14.042
She sent me away to keep me out of danger.

00:14:14.042 --> 00:14:16.750
I reported this to the school and Raika, too.

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:19.250
She should be headed
to the same place that we are.

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:26.875
Now I'm alone.

00:14:26.875 --> 00:14:29.333
We won't cause any trouble for anyone here.

00:14:38.500 --> 00:14:41.792
You guys look like ordinary punks.

00:14:41.792 --> 00:14:43.708
Do you have a grudge
against me or something?

00:14:45.375 --> 00:14:47.000
Shoot her!

00:14:50.583 --> 00:14:52.625
Split up into two groups
and attack her from both sides!

00:14:52.625 --> 00:14:54.375
They don't act like pros.

00:14:54.375 --> 00:14:55.875
They are small fries, as I thought.

00:14:58.875 --> 00:15:00.333
Three more to go.

00:15:05.958 --> 00:15:07.375
Two more.

00:15:17.417 --> 00:15:19.917
It's good to save bullets.

00:15:19.917 --> 00:15:21.500
Just one more.

00:15:25.667 --> 00:15:27.667
About twelve...

00:15:27.667 --> 00:15:32.750
Well, I guess I'll just steadily
take care of them one by one.

00:15:32.750 --> 00:15:34.708
Freeze! We're <i>butei</i>!

00:15:35.917 --> 00:15:38.042
You're surrounded!

00:15:38.042 --> 00:15:40.208
If you resist, we'll show no mercy!

00:15:40.208 --> 00:15:43.917
If you want to fall victim to my gun, come out.

00:15:43.917 --> 00:15:45.500
Where's the school and police backup?

00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:47.125
They'll be here soon!

00:15:47.125 --> 00:15:48.917
Aria...!

00:15:48.917 --> 00:15:51.583
Jonathan! Go!

00:15:55.708 --> 00:15:58.375
Yuyu! Yaya! Do it!

00:15:58.375 --> 00:15:59.958
Yes, Miss Urara!

00:15:59.958 --> 00:16:01.167
Take this!

00:16:03.417 --> 00:16:05.875
We successfully neutralized them.

00:16:07.458 --> 00:16:10.292
Actual battles really make me nervous.

00:16:10.292 --> 00:16:11.958
Aria?!

00:16:11.958 --> 00:16:14.708
Aria?! Where are you?!

00:16:16.792 --> 00:16:17.958
Aria!

00:16:17.958 --> 00:16:19.292
Akari! Watch out!

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:23.125
There are more left?!

00:16:25.792 --> 00:16:27.083
Akari!

00:16:33.167 --> 00:16:34.708
Akari! Use this!

00:16:36.667 --> 00:16:37.833
Ahh...

00:16:37.833 --> 00:16:39.750
You can aim the target from there, right?

00:16:49.167 --> 00:16:50.875
Akari! Shoot!

00:16:54.875 --> 00:16:56.000
Akari!

00:17:04.292 --> 00:17:05.333
Reki!

00:17:16.708 --> 00:17:20.917
Then those guys were trying
to retaliate against Aria?

00:17:20.917 --> 00:17:25.042
Yeah. I was told that they were part of
the bank robber group from the other day.

00:17:25.042 --> 00:17:27.167
Looks like it was a simple
personal vendetta against her.

00:17:27.167 --> 00:17:31.917
Then, this isn't related to the <i>butei</i>
attacks that have been happening lately?

00:17:31.917 --> 00:17:36.417
We have to investigate it to be sure,
but it doesn't look like they're connected.

00:17:36.417 --> 00:17:40.792
Anyway, you did a great job.
Look forward to your next rank consideration.

00:17:40.792 --> 00:17:42.417
Miss Mamiya...

00:17:42.417 --> 00:17:47.458
She'll probably be scolded quite a
bit since Aria got in a fix because of her.

00:17:47.458 --> 00:17:52.542
I'll have to comfort her later
with my whole heart and soul...

00:17:52.542 --> 00:17:54.042
Akari...

00:17:59.125 --> 00:18:00.000
Akari.

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:02.250
Y-Yes.

00:18:02.250 --> 00:18:06.500
Thanks for coming to help me.
It saved me time and effort.

00:18:07.792 --> 00:18:09.792
There are many things for you to reflect on,

00:18:09.792 --> 00:18:12.625
but discuss them with your friends later.

00:18:12.625 --> 00:18:14.333
Anyway, thank you for your help.

00:18:14.333 --> 00:18:16.167
Thank you very much!

00:18:16.167 --> 00:18:20.500
I was worried about how
much I'd be scolded by you.

00:18:20.500 --> 00:18:22.917
Ah, that's right!

00:18:22.917 --> 00:18:27.125
It's not like I got this back on my own, so...

00:18:27.125 --> 00:18:28.542
You don't have to return it to me.

00:18:28.542 --> 00:18:29.750
What?

00:18:29.750 --> 00:18:31.792
Your Amica test is over.

00:18:31.792 --> 00:18:33.792
I won't make you my Amica.

00:18:35.708 --> 00:18:37.375
You should transfer to a department

00:18:37.375 --> 00:18:39.708
where you can avoid
using guns as much as possible.

00:18:39.708 --> 00:18:42.083
Make the arrangement as soon as tomorrow.

00:18:42.083 --> 00:18:45.000
I-Is that...

00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:47.625
...because I made a mistake earlier?!

00:18:47.625 --> 00:18:50.292
Because you got into danger because of me?!

00:18:50.292 --> 00:18:52.542
Yeah, but that's not the only reason.

00:18:52.542 --> 00:18:53.792
What?

00:18:53.792 --> 00:18:56.458
This incident made me realize

00:18:56.458 --> 00:18:58.958
that as <i>butei</i>--

00:18:58.958 --> 00:19:03.250
no, as human beings,
you and I are too different.

00:19:03.250 --> 00:19:05.500
What do you mean?!

00:19:05.500 --> 00:19:07.583
I've been feeling that way for a while.

00:19:07.583 --> 00:19:10.042
I'm the type that runs at full speed alone.

00:19:10.042 --> 00:19:12.875
You're the type that works with
many friends, helping each other.

00:19:12.875 --> 00:19:16.750
Even if you learned my ways,
I don't think you'd gain much.

00:19:16.750 --> 00:19:17.792
But...!

00:19:17.792 --> 00:19:20.042
Stop trying to be like me.

00:19:20.042 --> 00:19:23.292
You're better off taking the
path that best suits your abilities.

00:19:23.292 --> 00:19:28.083
That's not true!
I admire you, Aria! You're perfect!

00:19:28.083 --> 00:19:30.667
I'm not perfect.

00:19:30.667 --> 00:19:34.167
There are many things I can't do.

00:19:34.167 --> 00:19:37.958
And there are many things
that you don't know about me.

00:19:37.958 --> 00:19:44.333
I'll do my best! I'll work hard so that
I can become your partner! So...!

00:19:44.333 --> 00:19:47.667
Then why didn't you shoot the perp earlier?!

00:19:47.667 --> 00:19:49.875
I'm not saying that you should've killed him.

00:19:49.875 --> 00:19:51.667
You couldn't even fire simple warning shots!

00:19:51.667 --> 00:19:54.125
What makes you think
that you can be my partner?!

00:19:56.458 --> 00:19:59.708
I often get involved in dangerous cases.

00:19:59.708 --> 00:20:02.375
It might put you in danger, too.

00:20:02.375 --> 00:20:06.292
That's another reason why
I won't make you my Amica.

00:20:06.292 --> 00:20:10.792
But... still... I want to...

00:20:12.417 --> 00:20:16.500
You looked relieved earlier
that you didn't have to shoot.

00:20:16.500 --> 00:20:17.833
Ah...

00:20:17.833 --> 00:20:23.333
You said that you admired me
for not fatally wounding criminals, too.

00:20:29.875 --> 00:20:31.750
Aria...

00:20:31.750 --> 00:20:36.875
I knew from the start that
you were hiding something.

00:20:36.875 --> 00:20:39.125
Let's discuss it first.

00:20:39.125 --> 00:20:41.708
Now, try shooting.

00:20:41.708 --> 00:20:43.042
I don't want to.

00:20:43.042 --> 00:20:44.208
Akari...

00:20:44.208 --> 00:20:45.250
I don't want to!

00:20:45.250 --> 00:20:46.750
Shoot!

00:20:50.208 --> 00:20:56.417
Forehead, right eye, left eye, throat,
and heart... All shots hit the mark!

00:20:58.667 --> 00:21:01.208
If I had shot that time...

00:21:01.208 --> 00:21:03.917
...that perp would've been dead.

00:21:03.917 --> 00:21:07.208
A <i>butei </i>shouldn't have a skill like this!

00:21:07.208 --> 00:21:08.625
Akari!

00:21:12.333 --> 00:21:15.000
I heard that you used
another diversionary tactic.

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:20.375
That's right. I instigated some stupid
punks to keep Aria and Reki's company.

00:21:20.375 --> 00:21:23.750
Thanks to that, they arrived safely.

00:21:23.750 --> 00:21:26.458
We can finally start our operation...

00:21:26.458 --> 00:21:30.417
...in which we each abduct or kill our target.

00:21:30.417 --> 00:21:32.750
My target is Aria.

00:21:32.750 --> 00:21:36.375
I need you to eliminate Aria Kanzaki first.

00:21:36.375 --> 00:21:40.125
It's hard to do my work when
an S-ranked<i> butei </i>is on the loose.

00:21:40.125 --> 00:21:42.458
Aria is a piece of cake.

00:21:42.458 --> 00:21:44.333
But are you ready, Kyo?

00:21:45.708 --> 00:21:48.417
It's about time for a poisonous flower to bloom.

00:21:48.417 --> 00:21:50.583
It's a good time to start the operation.

00:21:50.583 --> 00:21:53.500
Just one thing.
Let's not get in each other's way.

00:21:53.500 --> 00:21:56.417
Even if you make a mistake,
I won't help you, okay?

00:21:56.417 --> 00:22:00.000
Thanks for coming all the way... Sis...

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:02.917
It's an easy task, just like picking a flower.

00:22:05.292 --> 00:22:06.958
My target is...

00:22:06.958 --> 00:22:08.667
"Episode 9: Home Visit"

00:22:08.667 --> 00:22:10.958
"Episode 9: Home Visit"
...Akari Mamiya.

00:23:41.625 --> 00:23:44.250
--Two gunshot wounds to the head...!
--Aria is...

00:23:44.250 --> 00:23:47.833
--She's exhibiting signs of disorientation...!
--...an impeccable...

00:23:47.833 --> 00:23:49.042
...<i>butei</i>...!

00:23:49.667 --> 00:23:54.083
I want it... I really, really want it.

00:23:54.083 --> 00:23:55.250
Let's play.

00:23:55.250 --> 00:23:56.160
"Episode 10: First Mission"
